# canvas-app: soma-messages
# 0.8.8, Boss's five from testing 0.8.7: photos open over the chat, X previews, search icon, no "from your Mac", Delivered.
# Isolated DEMO only: sample chats, its own token (INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN, INJECT_DEMO_HOST and INJECT_DEMO_PORT, the Mac's tailnet address: the app refuses any other plain http).
# The X post is a real public one (Cove's verified photo probe), read from X's public feed by the phone.
fold folded
wait 1500
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key HOME
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2FINJECT_DEMO_HOST%3AINJECT_DEMO_PORT&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
shot link-dialog
tap Link
wait 5000
expect Weekend

# --- Header: the name alone, a search icon with no word beside it; the icon still answers to Search.
tap Sideways
wait 1500
expect Photo
absent from your Mac
absent iMessage ·
absent OpenBubbles
shot cover-header card=messages-parity-chat-header
# --- A real picture over the chat, not the gallery.
tap Photo
wait 900
expect Photo, full screen
absent Message time
shot cover-photo-open card=messages-photo-viewer
# A small drag settles back; it stays open.
swipe 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.54 400
wait 700
expect Photo, full screen
swipe 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.92 200
wait 900
absent Photo, full screen
expect Sideways
key BACK
wait 800

# --- Same place in the chat: a chat longer than the screen, read from partway up.
tap Weekend
wait 1500
tap Message
type one
key ENTER
wait 500
type two
key ENTER
wait 500
type three
key ENTER
wait 500
type four
key ENTER
wait 500
type five
key ENTER
wait 500
type six
key ENTER
wait 3500
closeime
wait 800
# Item 5: the newest of mine. A live send here says Sent; the demo's history says Delivered, read on a fresh start.
shot cover-sent-beside-tail card=messages-parity-status
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.messages
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
wait 2000
tap Weekend
wait 2000
expect Delivered
shot cover-delivered card=messages-parity-status
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.62 700
wait 1200
expect Photo
shot cover-before-photo
tap Photo
wait 900
expect Photo, full screen
shot cover-small-photo-open
key BACK
wait 900
absent Photo, full screen
shot cover-after-back
tap Photo
wait 900
expect Photo, full screen
swipe 0.5 0.6 0.5 0.1 200
wait 900
absent Photo, full screen
shot cover-after-swipe
key BACK
wait 800

# --- An X link with no metadata from the Mac: the phone reads the post and the card has its picture.
tap Link previews
wait 1500
tap Message
type https://x.com/BarackObama/status/266031293945503744
wait 5000
closeime
wait 500
shot cover-x-draft
tap Send
# The demo's reply repeats the link with no metadata from the Mac: this card is the phone reading X.
wait 5000
closeime
wait 1000
expect Four more years
expect Link preview image
shot cover-x-preview card=messages-parity-links

# --- Unfolded: the same, beside the panel.
fold open
wait 2500
tap Link previews
wait 1500
absent from your Mac
expect Four more years
shot unfolded-x-preview card=messages-parity-links-unfolded
tap Weekend
wait 1500
absent from your Mac
shot unfolded-header-delivered card=messages-parity-status
swipe 0.65 0.3 0.65 0.62 700
wait 1200
shot unfolded-before-photo
tap Photo
wait 900
expect Photo, full screen
shot unfolded-photo-open card=messages-photo-viewer
swipe 0.5 0.6 0.5 0.1 200
wait 900
absent Photo, full screen
shot unfolded-after-swipe
tap Photo
wait 900
key BACK
wait 900
absent Photo, full screen
shot unfolded-after-back
# The side panel opens a picture the same way.
tap 1 Photo
wait 1500
expect Photo, full screen
shot unfolded-panel-photo-open card=messages-photo-viewer
key BACK
wait 900
absent Photo, full screen
fold folded
wait 1500
